# People Profiles Directory

This directory contains individual profile pages for tango figures.

## File Format
- One markdown file per person: `[slug].md`
- Frontmatter with structured metadata
- Body with biography, videos, links, cross-references

## See Also
- Queue: `/docs/queues/people-queue.json`
- Template: `/docs/prompts/person-research-template.md`
- Documentation: `/public/tango-papers/README-CONTENT-SYSTEM.md` (Part 9)
